        "Description": "A triumvirate of big-shot pharmacy associates have gathered undercover on Haven Island to negotiate continued monopolisation of the medicinal market. These people have sacrificed lives for profit, and several faulty batches of so-called medicine have  caused countless deaths. Eliminate them, preferably so that they may meet the same end that they caused so many innocent people. Good Luck 47!",
